      "id": "data_analyst",
      "name": "Data Analyst",
      "description": "Data analysts collect, clean and analyze data to answer business questions. They write SQL queries against relational databases, analyze data in Python or R with pandas, and use Excel for quick analysis. They build dashboards and data visualizations in Tableau or Power BI, apply statistics and A/B testing to measure impact, and present insights and reports to stakeholders.",
